::EPI-W11-050::In field scenario 1, why describe cases by person, place and time before selecting an analytic study? {
=The pattern identifies the population at risk and generates testable hypotheses#Correct.
~It proves causation without comparison#Description directs the next analytic question.
~It eliminates the need for data cleaning#Description directs the next analytic question.
~It guarantees laboratory confirmation#Description directs the next analytic question.
}

